WEBVTT

00:00:07.240 --> 00:00:14.360
<i>A new kind of disease has been 
spreading among young people.</i>

00:00:14.360 --> 00:00:17.660
<i>Following prolonged 
periods of Internet usage,</i>

00:00:17.660 --> 00:00:23.120
<i>sufferers develop a pathological 
dependence on the Internet.</i>

00:00:23.870 --> 00:00:27.880
<i>Experts have named this 
disease "Internet Addiction."</i>

00:00:28.970 --> 00:00:34.850
<i>In order to get these addicted 
youngsters back on the right track</i>

00:00:34.850 --> 00:00:39.140
<i>and reform them into independent, 
self-respecting adults,</i>

00:00:39.720 --> 00:00:45.890
<i>the Elite Reeducation Academy, 
a civilian educational facility, was created.</i>

00:00:46.970 --> 00:00:53.730
<i>It is a place to help young 
people to grow up right.</i>

00:02:27.710 --> 00:02:33.500
Episode 3 
Short-Sighted Justice

00:02:27.950 --> 00:02:29.490
One more time!

00:02:29.490 --> 00:02:30.480
Again?!

00:02:30.480 --> 00:02:33.360
Shiori, enough! I don't want to 
see you force yourself like this.

00:02:33.360 --> 00:02:36.840
I'm not that cruel.
Please don't hurt yourself any more.

00:02:42.250 --> 00:02:44.410
It's none of your business.

00:02:44.410 --> 00:02:46.240
It's my own problem.

00:02:46.740 --> 00:02:47.930
Hibiki, was it?

00:02:48.740 --> 00:02:50.340
You remember me?

00:02:50.340 --> 00:02:51.240
I'm glad...

00:02:51.240 --> 00:02:52.260
You're glad?

00:02:52.680 --> 00:02:55.440
The fact that you're here 
means you're garbage, right?

00:02:55.760 --> 00:02:57.940
You quit running and got 
addicted to the Internet?

00:02:59.460 --> 00:03:01.900
Well, it wasn't quite as simple as that...

00:03:02.550 --> 00:03:04.740
You went missing, too...

00:03:04.740 --> 00:03:05.750
Stop.

00:03:05.750 --> 00:03:07.220
I don't want to hear about it.

00:03:07.220 --> 00:03:10.700
And while we're talking about this,
 we're wasting time.

00:03:10.700 --> 00:03:11.920
Let's continue.

00:03:11.920 --> 00:03:13.200
I won't barf again.

00:03:13.200 --> 00:03:15.600
I'll do anything to get what I need.

00:03:15.600 --> 00:03:17.470
I really need a cell phone.

00:03:17.470 --> 00:03:18.900
It's not for your benefit.

00:03:20.920 --> 00:03:21.920
Shiori...

00:03:22.500 --> 00:03:26.020
Please, don't say such cruel things!

00:03:26.020 --> 00:03:28.190
I don't know what you're doing here,

00:03:28.190 --> 00:03:30.100
but you must have been through a lot.

00:03:30.100 --> 00:03:31.850
I-I'll help you.

00:03:31.850 --> 00:03:33.940
I'll help you escape this school, 
and get a cell phone.

00:03:33.940 --> 00:03:35.490
Please believe me.

00:03:35.490 --> 00:03:38.440
I might not be the most reliable, 
but I will help you!

00:03:38.440 --> 00:03:40.440
Oh, sorry! I forgot!

00:03:44.410 --> 00:03:46.400
Let's drop the platitudes.

00:03:46.400 --> 00:03:48.910
I don't trust anyone anymore.

00:03:51.810 --> 00:03:54.640
Then I'll make us some proof, first.

00:03:54.640 --> 00:03:57.420
I promise I'll help you.

00:03:59.300 --> 00:04:03.670
<i>It's amazing that I can feel benevolent, 
even while doing something like this...</i>

00:04:03.670 --> 00:04:06.770
Even a jerk like me can help another person.

00:04:07.330 --> 00:04:10.170
<i>Why did I ever think about 
jumping to my death?</i>

00:04:10.560 --> 00:04:12.570
<i>For Shiori's sake...</i>

00:04:12.570 --> 00:04:15.300
<i>To become someone she can 
rely on, I need to work hard!</i>

00:04:15.300 --> 00:04:18.080
<i>Then we'll be like we used to be...</i>

00:04:18.080 --> 00:04:20.770
<i>Or maybe we can be even closer...</i>

00:04:24.280 --> 00:04:25.900
Huh? Oh, no!

00:04:25.900 --> 00:04:27.920
I can't do it unless I fantasize!

00:04:27.920 --> 00:04:29.710
My mind has been too purified!

00:04:29.710 --> 00:04:32.410
My hand's swollen up, 
but my dick's still limp!

00:04:32.630 --> 00:04:34.410
Hey, aren't you done yet?

00:04:35.770 --> 00:04:38.740
I'm... I'm almost there! Almost!

00:04:38.740 --> 00:04:39.420
Stay back!

00:04:39.690 --> 00:04:41.540
If you can't make it happen, it's okay.

00:04:44.890 --> 00:04:47.400
He said we had to offer proof.

00:04:47.400 --> 00:04:51.310
If I can't make it happen, I'll find 
something else to offer instead...

00:04:52.360 --> 00:04:55.230
Anyway, I'll put this in and 
show it to him as proof.

00:04:55.230 --> 00:04:57.800
Shiori, you go get the cell phone.

00:04:57.800 --> 00:04:59.730
I'll work something else out.

00:05:02.140 --> 00:05:03.570
Thank you.

00:05:04.740 --> 00:05:08.240
You're gross, and you've 
grown utterly detestable.

00:05:08.240 --> 00:05:10.400
But you're as soft-hearted as you ever were.

00:05:11.060 --> 00:05:13.640
I don't entirely dislike you.

00:05:18.560 --> 00:05:22.440
If anyone bullies you, I'll cut them down.

00:05:24.040 --> 00:05:25.090
See you.

00:05:41.680 --> 00:05:43.930
That asshole Shin! He tricked me.

00:05:43.940 --> 00:05:46.100
He said I could have the cell phone,

00:05:46.100 --> 00:05:50.240
but he didn't crack the password, 
and he even ended up giving it to Shiori!

00:05:52.180 --> 00:05:54.250
He's got guts, I guess.

00:05:54.250 --> 00:05:56.170
Turning on me like this...

00:05:56.170 --> 00:05:59.210
Maybe he needs a reminder 
of the pecking order here!

00:06:05.180 --> 00:06:06.690
All done?

00:06:06.690 --> 00:06:07.420
Where's the proof?

00:06:11.040 --> 00:06:12.380
I underestimated you.

00:06:12.380 --> 00:06:14.820
Not bad at all, for your first time.

00:06:15.160 --> 00:06:15.930
But...

00:06:17.070 --> 00:06:20.020
What is that smell?

00:06:20.370 --> 00:06:21.940
What were you doing in there?

00:06:23.550 --> 00:06:26.860
What matters is we kept our promises.

00:06:26.860 --> 00:06:30.650
So, Shin-kun, let me tell you this one thing.

00:06:30.650 --> 00:06:35.410
You mustn't use women's 
bodies as articles of trade.

00:06:40.620 --> 00:06:43.030
You'd better watch your mouth around me.

00:06:43.030 --> 00:06:45.920
You don't seem to have 
realized your place here yet.

00:06:46.660 --> 00:06:49.040
You are my dog.

00:06:49.040 --> 00:06:52.940
Starting today, you'll call me this:

00:06:53.970 --> 00:06:55.940
"Master."

00:06:56.920 --> 00:06:59.330
M-Master?

00:06:59.330 --> 00:07:01.500
How dare you look down on me like this?!

00:07:01.500 --> 00:07:02.930
Looking down on you?

00:07:03.470 --> 00:07:07.500
Do weaklings like you really 
hate being belittled?

00:07:07.500 --> 00:07:10.020
You should be glad.

00:07:10.450 --> 00:07:13.340
As my dog, my glory reflects upon you.

00:07:13.340 --> 00:07:17.910
And you'll get more delicious 
treats like you did today, too.

00:07:17.910 --> 00:07:19.480
I won't be your dog.

00:07:22.720 --> 00:07:25.820
The only thing I promised 
was not to kill myself!

00:07:25.820 --> 00:07:26.920
That's all!

00:07:27.490 --> 00:07:30.260
Starting now, you and I 
are nothing to each other.

00:07:30.260 --> 00:07:31.840
Stay away from me!

00:07:34.820 --> 00:07:37.500
<i>I'd do anything for Shiori.</i>

00:07:38.710 --> 00:07:40.170
<i>One day, she and I...</i>

00:07:40.170 --> 00:07:45.070
<i>We'll escape from this garbage heap together!</i>

00:07:47.940 --> 00:07:52.660
He's acting exactly as I predicted.

00:08:03.920 --> 00:08:05.650
Hey, it's the new kid!

00:08:05.650 --> 00:08:08.290
Looks like a completely hopeless case.

00:08:08.290 --> 00:08:10.860
What a cute little doggy!

00:08:10.860 --> 00:08:12.830
That new jersey of his looks pretty snazzy.

00:08:12.830 --> 00:08:16.760
<i>It's going to be hard to 
keep myself safe like this.</i>

00:08:16.760 --> 00:08:19.200
<i>They took my cell phone and my wallet.</i>

00:08:19.200 --> 00:08:20.810
<i>I don't have anything.</i>

00:08:20.810 --> 00:08:23.620
<i>The school is surrounded by high fences.</i>

00:08:23.620 --> 00:08:25.940
<i>I don't even know where this place is.</i>

00:08:26.410 --> 00:08:30.440
<i>Maybe I'll stop by the dorm 
and think things over from there.</i>

00:08:35.480 --> 00:08:38.080
<i>No matter what demon lies beyond that door...</i>

00:08:38.080 --> 00:08:41.060
<i>for Shiori's sake, I must confront it.</i>

00:08:41.060 --> 00:08:42.410
Hey, you!

00:08:42.880 --> 00:08:44.410
Yeah, the new kid.

00:08:44.410 --> 00:08:46.640
Hibiki-kun, right?

00:08:46.640 --> 00:08:47.410
Nice to meet you.

00:08:48.440 --> 00:08:49.980
Go on inside.

00:08:49.980 --> 00:08:52.550
Your roommates are waiting inside. Go on.

00:08:57.430 --> 00:09:00.930
Hibiki-kun! Welcome to room 420!

00:09:02.690 --> 00:09:04.630
Go on in quick!

00:09:04.630 --> 00:09:05.830
This is your bed here.

00:09:05.830 --> 00:09:06.740
Make yourself at home.

00:09:06.740 --> 00:09:08.940
We're all brothers from now on.

00:09:10.770 --> 00:09:11.690
Brothers?

00:09:11.930 --> 00:09:13.440
My name is Bin.

00:09:13.440 --> 00:09:15.440
You can call me "Big Bro."

00:09:15.440 --> 00:09:17.620
I'm the dorm head.

00:09:17.620 --> 00:09:19.240
I'm usually in the dorm office.

00:09:19.240 --> 00:09:21.140
If anything happens, let me know.

00:09:21.140 --> 00:09:23.400
Right. Thanks, Big Bro.

00:09:23.800 --> 00:09:25.200
I'm the dorm prefect, Kyo.

00:09:25.760 --> 00:09:26.620
I'm Rai!

00:09:27.020 --> 00:09:28.420
Toh here!

00:09:28.900 --> 00:09:30.920
I feel like fate has brought us together.

00:09:30.920 --> 00:09:32.020
Let's commemorate the occasion.

00:09:32.020 --> 00:09:32.920
Smile, everyone!

00:09:36.390 --> 00:09:39.240
Well, I've got some things to take care of.

00:09:39.240 --> 00:09:41.440
Kyo, you handle the rest.

00:09:41.440 --> 00:09:42.930
If anything happens, stop on by.

00:09:43.620 --> 00:09:45.430
Yes, Big Bro!

00:09:57.660 --> 00:10:01.270
Hibiki-kun, we worked so hard on 
the welcome party preparations.

00:10:01.270 --> 00:10:02.600
Now we're totally starving.

00:10:02.600 --> 00:10:04.490
Could you buy us some food?

00:10:06.480 --> 00:10:07.580
Food?

00:10:07.580 --> 00:10:08.840
D-Do I need money for that?

00:10:08.840 --> 00:10:12.920
Come on! You're friends with <i>him</i>, 
right? You won't need money!

00:10:12.920 --> 00:10:15.680
We asked the other new kids to 
handle your daily necessities.

00:10:15.680 --> 00:10:18.420
And we'll set up your other 
belongings, so just leave it to us.

00:10:18.420 --> 00:10:19.650
Go get us some lunch!

00:10:19.650 --> 00:10:21.650
We appreciate it! Come back quick, okay?

00:10:24.100 --> 00:10:27.940
I don't... <i>think</i> that was bullying.

00:10:40.400 --> 00:10:43.900
These options all sound surprisingly tasty.

00:10:44.560 --> 00:10:45.910
Oh, excuse me.

00:10:45.910 --> 00:10:48.280
Hey, I haven't seen you around here before.

00:10:48.280 --> 00:10:49.300
New kid?

00:10:49.300 --> 00:10:52.420
Yes, could I have the C Lunch Set for four?

00:10:52.420 --> 00:10:54.490
I see. Certainly.

00:10:54.820 --> 00:10:55.920
Thank you, sir.

00:10:55.920 --> 00:10:57.060
Please use these.

00:10:57.060 --> 00:10:59.060
Take your time. I'm in no hurry.

00:11:00.130 --> 00:11:00.920
Hey.

00:11:01.810 --> 00:11:03.360
What are you doing?

00:11:03.360 --> 00:11:05.430
If you want food, 
hand over your meal tickets!

00:11:05.430 --> 00:11:07.930
M-Meal tickets?

00:11:07.930 --> 00:11:09.940
It's too expensive...

00:11:09.940 --> 00:11:11.760
I don't have any money.

00:11:11.760 --> 00:11:13.440
Then eat the free stuff!

00:11:13.440 --> 00:11:14.940
Get it over there!

00:11:14.940 --> 00:11:16.820
Hand over your dishes.

00:11:17.900 --> 00:11:19.940
Is this all we get?

00:11:19.940 --> 00:11:21.290
Got a problem with that?

00:11:21.580 --> 00:11:25.410
I'm sorry, sir... 
Could I get a few more pickles?

00:11:25.770 --> 00:11:28.490
Sir?! Are you mocking me?

00:11:28.490 --> 00:11:29.540
I'm a woman!

00:11:29.540 --> 00:11:31.410
Get out of my sight right now!

00:11:32.850 --> 00:11:34.420
What's going on here?

00:11:37.520 --> 00:11:39.920
I guess everyone is eating this stuff.

00:11:39.920 --> 00:11:42.570
Meal tickets must be expensive.

00:11:42.570 --> 00:11:45.730
I guess living in poverty really is hard.

00:11:47.890 --> 00:11:50.770
Hibiki-chan, want to join me?

00:11:50.770 --> 00:11:56.450
If you hold out your paw, wag your tail,
 and revere me as your master,

00:11:56.450 --> 00:11:58.940
you can get all the delicious food you want.

00:11:59.700 --> 00:12:02.440
Give me a break! I don't wanna eat that crap!

00:12:08.700 --> 00:12:11.390
I won't yield to him.

00:12:11.390 --> 00:12:14.170
But boy is this steamed bun gross...

00:12:19.840 --> 00:12:21.840
Hey, new kid...

00:12:21.840 --> 00:12:24.080
We gave you that nice welcome,

00:12:24.080 --> 00:12:25.760
and you want us to eat this?

00:12:25.760 --> 00:12:27.050
This is ridiculous.

00:12:27.050 --> 00:12:30.060
But this was the only free stuff they had.

00:12:30.060 --> 00:12:31.650
This was mine,

00:12:31.650 --> 00:12:34.560
but I got so hungry, I ate 
it all on the way back.

00:12:34.990 --> 00:12:38.000
<i>He ate all that gross stuff?</i>

00:12:38.000 --> 00:12:39.060
<i>Are you kidding me?</i>

00:12:39.530 --> 00:12:41.430
Hey, Hibiki-kun.

00:12:41.430 --> 00:12:44.920
If you're that hungry, you can eat ours, too.

00:12:44.920 --> 00:12:47.060
Really? Are you sure?

00:12:47.060 --> 00:12:49.490
We said you could eat, so eat!

00:12:49.490 --> 00:12:51.570
Okay. If you insist...

00:12:52.080 --> 00:12:53.370
That was great.

00:12:53.370 --> 00:12:55.580
If only I had some water, 
it would be perfect.

00:12:55.580 --> 00:12:59.070
I was out all night gaming yesterday, 
and I hadn't eaten anything.

00:12:59.070 --> 00:13:02.580
The steamed buns were small, but the 
pickles and tofu were pretty good!

00:13:04.200 --> 00:13:06.260
So, Hibiki-kun...

00:13:06.260 --> 00:13:08.830
Where's the feast for us?

00:13:09.540 --> 00:13:10.710
Feast?

00:13:11.210 --> 00:13:13.320
I didn't think you were this cheap.

00:13:13.320 --> 00:13:14.890
You're Shin's underling, right?

00:13:14.890 --> 00:13:16.060
At least treat us to some good food.

00:13:16.610 --> 00:13:17.730
Wait a minute.

00:13:17.730 --> 00:13:18.860
What are you talking about?

00:13:18.860 --> 00:13:20.560
Shin's underling?

00:13:21.000 --> 00:13:23.310
I don't have anything to do with him!

00:13:26.730 --> 00:13:29.980
He did ask me, but I turned him down.

00:13:31.700 --> 00:13:33.080
Come here a minute.

00:13:33.560 --> 00:13:35.070
What's going on here?

00:13:35.070 --> 00:13:37.100
Who was it who said he was Shin's underling?

00:13:37.100 --> 00:13:38.050
Big Bro did!

00:13:38.050 --> 00:13:40.280
You're saying Big Bro's info was wrong?

00:13:40.280 --> 00:13:41.250
Well, never mind.

00:13:41.250 --> 00:13:43.060
There's one thing we know for sure.

00:13:43.400 --> 00:13:45.570
He isn't lying.

00:13:46.100 --> 00:13:49.050
Which means... Damn it...

00:13:51.240 --> 00:13:52.050
What?

00:13:52.050 --> 00:13:53.550
Close the door.

00:13:54.400 --> 00:13:55.550
What's going on?

00:13:55.550 --> 00:13:56.510
You bastard.

00:13:56.510 --> 00:13:59.560
We gave you that welcome because we 
thought you were Shin's underling!

00:13:59.560 --> 00:14:01.560
We bent over backwards for nothing!

00:14:01.560 --> 00:14:02.790
<i>Damn it.</i>

00:14:02.790 --> 00:14:04.560
<i>I should have known this would happen.</i>

00:14:04.560 --> 00:14:05.810
Okay, everyone.

00:14:05.810 --> 00:14:07.140
Let's give him what he deserves!

00:14:07.140 --> 00:14:08.070
Let's go!

00:14:11.570 --> 00:14:14.580
Hey, why are you just moving your fingers?

00:14:14.580 --> 00:14:17.080
Damn, it's my bad habit of 
forgetting I'm not at a keyboard!

00:14:17.280 --> 00:14:20.090
Looks like we'll all have to get him at once!

00:14:23.270 --> 00:14:25.480
What, no one's gonna move?

00:14:25.480 --> 00:14:28.600
You should start! I'm always a support class!

00:14:28.600 --> 00:14:30.090
I always play ranged classes.

00:14:30.090 --> 00:14:32.790
You gotta be kidding! I was a healer!

00:14:32.790 --> 00:14:34.560
How are we gonna fight without a warrior?

00:14:34.560 --> 00:14:38.390
Actually, I was a pretty good warrior...

00:14:38.390 --> 00:14:39.080
I see!

00:14:39.080 --> 00:14:40.260
Welcome! Thank you for coming!

00:14:40.260 --> 00:14:41.720
Step right this way!

00:14:42.560 --> 00:14:45.080
Damn you for mocking us!

00:14:46.120 --> 00:14:47.560
Please lay off!

00:14:50.480 --> 00:14:51.980
Died again.

00:14:52.450 --> 00:14:53.480
Damn it!

00:14:57.420 --> 00:14:59.160
Where's that lunch?!

00:15:02.590 --> 00:15:04.170
What's going on?

00:15:04.170 --> 00:15:06.440
I just moved my hands forward to block...

00:15:08.360 --> 00:15:12.430
Have I acquired some amazing superpower?

00:15:22.450 --> 00:15:25.570
Now, awaken, Hibiki!

00:15:25.890 --> 00:15:29.600
Destroy this wall and save Shiori!

00:15:34.920 --> 00:15:36.660
It hurts!

00:15:36.660 --> 00:15:39.080
I guess I didn't acquire a superpower!

00:15:40.480 --> 00:15:43.580
Damn you... How dare you turn on us!

00:15:44.580 --> 00:15:46.080
Hey, stay back!

00:15:52.250 --> 00:15:56.050
It's not that I acquired a superpower.

00:15:56.420 --> 00:15:59.570
You're just all so malnourished, 
it's a miracle you're even alive.

00:16:00.240 --> 00:16:02.630
Your faces look pretty healthy, at least.

00:16:02.630 --> 00:16:05.690
Big Bro told us to put on makeup.

00:16:05.690 --> 00:16:10.080
Without it, we look like this.

00:16:10.080 --> 00:16:11.290
Come on, Brother!

00:16:11.290 --> 00:16:13.530
We've been eating nothing 
but those steamed buns!

00:16:13.530 --> 00:16:16.080
The drills are so harsh. 
We're on the verge of death.

00:16:16.080 --> 00:16:17.800
<i>They're calling me Brother?</i>

00:16:17.800 --> 00:16:21.080
<i>To think there are people out 
there more pathetic than I am...</i>

00:16:21.260 --> 00:16:25.120
And Big Bro always picks fights with us
 and makes us pay protection money...

00:16:25.120 --> 00:16:27.170
We get so little to live on.

00:16:27.170 --> 00:16:29.690
Then it almost all gets taken, 
so we can't even eat.

00:16:29.690 --> 00:16:31.540
We don't care what it is.

00:16:31.540 --> 00:16:33.230
We just want to eat our fill!

00:16:33.230 --> 00:16:36.890
That's right. We just want to eat our fill!

00:16:38.360 --> 00:16:39.550
Fine.

00:16:39.550 --> 00:16:44.300
Then, I'll ask Big Bro
 to stop exploiting you.

00:16:44.300 --> 00:16:45.570
Oh, no!

00:16:45.570 --> 00:16:46.620
Don't do it.

00:16:46.620 --> 00:16:49.320
If you get on Big Bro's bad side,
 it won't end well!

00:16:56.940 --> 00:17:00.080
Big Bro, it's Hibiki from room 420.

00:17:02.080 --> 00:17:04.160
Big Bro, I'm coming in.

00:17:04.160 --> 00:17:07.090
I need to talk to you. May I?

00:17:09.080 --> 00:17:10.240
What the hell...

00:17:10.570 --> 00:17:12.580
Are you working?

00:17:15.210 --> 00:17:16.690
Wait, is this...

00:17:17.720 --> 00:17:19.360
an online game?

00:17:20.900 --> 00:17:22.370
I died again.

00:17:22.370 --> 00:17:23.810
Their accuracy's too damn high.

00:17:25.060 --> 00:17:27.560
Oh, it's you, Hibiki-kun.

00:17:27.560 --> 00:17:29.300
Did you bring some food?

00:17:29.820 --> 00:17:31.720
No, I...

00:17:32.070 --> 00:17:34.070
Out of Range

00:17:32.660 --> 00:17:34.070
What?

00:17:34.070 --> 00:17:35.500
There's no signal...

00:17:36.570 --> 00:17:38.570
Input Password

00:17:38.970 --> 00:17:40.420
What's going on here?

00:17:40.900 --> 00:17:42.080
Hey.

00:17:42.080 --> 00:17:43.620
Don't be startled.

00:17:43.620 --> 00:17:47.090
Sorry, but that cell phone won't help you.

00:17:47.500 --> 00:17:50.580
I'll get you another one, so give it back.

00:17:51.410 --> 00:17:54.330
You think I'd trust a con artist like you?

00:17:55.760 --> 00:17:57.610
Class is starting soon.

00:17:57.610 --> 00:17:59.080
That's your only warning.

00:18:04.760 --> 00:18:08.060
If you're not here to bring me food, 
what could you possibly want?

00:18:08.580 --> 00:18:12.060
If you have something 
to say, say it. I'm busy.

00:18:12.060 --> 00:18:14.800
I heard you've been exploiting your students.

00:18:14.800 --> 00:18:16.580
You need to stop doing that.

00:18:17.570 --> 00:18:18.860
Exploiting?

00:18:18.860 --> 00:18:20.860
What are you talking about?

00:18:20.860 --> 00:18:22.410
Feigning ignorance?

00:18:22.410 --> 00:18:24.080
You've been playing games, right?

00:18:24.370 --> 00:18:25.980
So what if I have?

00:18:25.980 --> 00:18:28.780
Look, I'm not a student.

00:18:28.780 --> 00:18:32.040
I'm free to play games if I want to.

00:18:32.040 --> 00:18:33.500
What business is it of yours?

00:18:33.500 --> 00:18:37.010
And they said you've been 
confiscating their allowances.

00:18:37.010 --> 00:18:38.200
Why would you do that?

00:18:38.200 --> 00:18:39.420
You said you were family.

00:18:39.420 --> 00:18:40.480
They call you "Big Bro."

00:18:40.480 --> 00:18:41.990
What the hell is your problem?

00:18:41.990 --> 00:18:44.050
You want to lecture me?

00:18:44.050 --> 00:18:46.300
You only just got here,

00:18:46.300 --> 00:18:47.930
and you want to act all high and mighty?

00:18:47.930 --> 00:18:48.900
Listen up.

00:18:48.900 --> 00:18:51.280
If you get in the way of my becoming rich,

00:18:51.280 --> 00:18:54.070
I'll treat you to a fate worse than death.

00:18:57.980 --> 00:19:01.200
You'd better head for the 
athletic field right now.

00:19:01.200 --> 00:19:02.800
Class is about to start.

00:19:02.800 --> 00:19:05.310
If you're late, you're gonna pay.

00:19:05.310 --> 00:19:07.790
Oh, that's right! Crap!

00:19:09.760 --> 00:19:11.570
What a total dunce.

00:19:13.600 --> 00:19:17.100
Is everyone in this school totally crazy?

00:19:17.100 --> 00:19:19.600
Okay, class is starting!

00:19:23.050 --> 00:19:26.560
We'll split into two groups 
for lawn mowing and cleaning.

00:19:26.560 --> 00:19:29.570
I want it all done within one hour.

00:19:29.570 --> 00:19:31.080
Hey, over here.

00:19:32.560 --> 00:19:35.040
Thank goodness. I made it in time.

00:19:35.040 --> 00:19:38.010
Hibiki, did you really 
visit Big Bro's office?

00:19:38.010 --> 00:19:38.980
I did.

00:19:38.980 --> 00:19:40.720
So? What did he say?

00:19:42.170 --> 00:19:45.570
See? I told you not to piss him off!

00:19:47.430 --> 00:19:48.940
I guess I'm lucky.

00:19:48.940 --> 00:19:50.810
My first class is gym!

00:19:50.810 --> 00:19:53.020
Guess I'd better do some warm-up stretches.

00:19:53.020 --> 00:19:55.080
Hibiki, enough with the jokes!

00:19:55.080 --> 00:19:56.610
This isn't an ordinary school!

00:19:56.610 --> 00:19:58.400
We have barely any time in classrooms!

00:19:58.400 --> 00:20:00.320
It's training from morning till night!

00:20:00.320 --> 00:20:02.600
To put it bluntly, 
it's basically military training!

00:20:03.400 --> 00:20:04.550
No way...

00:20:04.550 --> 00:20:07.180
Here comes the head instructor. 
He leads this class.

00:20:14.420 --> 00:20:15.560
Group four!

00:20:15.560 --> 00:20:17.060
Form rank!

00:20:17.440 --> 00:20:19.220
Turn right for instruction!

00:20:20.200 --> 00:20:21.330
Ranks, count off!

00:20:21.330 --> 00:20:21.650
One!

00:20:21.650 --> 00:20:21.910
Two!

00:20:21.910 --> 00:20:22.220
Three!

00:20:22.220 --> 00:20:22.440
Four!

00:20:22.440 --> 00:20:22.750
Five!

00:20:22.750 --> 00:20:23.010
Six!

00:20:23.010 --> 00:20:23.370
Seven!

00:20:23.370 --> 00:20:23.650
Eight!

00:20:23.650 --> 00:20:24.010
Nine!

00:20:24.010 --> 00:20:24.320
Ten!

00:20:26.660 --> 00:20:27.720
I have a r-report!

00:20:27.720 --> 00:20:30.620
Group four previously had 46 members,
 but today we have 50!

00:20:30.620 --> 00:20:31.590
Please instruct!

00:20:34.710 --> 00:20:35.740
You idiot!

00:20:35.740 --> 00:20:36.590
Speak properly!

00:20:36.590 --> 00:20:38.580
S-Sorry...

00:20:38.600 --> 00:20:39.920
Do a five-kilometer run!

00:20:39.920 --> 00:20:41.580
Then 30 push-ups!

00:20:42.810 --> 00:20:44.330
Y-Yes, sir.

00:20:45.260 --> 00:20:47.460
I'm sorry, sir! I'm sorry!

00:20:48.910 --> 00:20:50.570
We have some new arrivals,

00:20:50.570 --> 00:20:53.060
so let me explain the school 
rules one more time.

00:20:53.060 --> 00:20:54.880
Listen up, all of you!

00:20:55.610 --> 00:20:59.860
First, you'll be up and ready by 7:00 AM,
 then head out for training.

00:21:00.330 --> 00:21:02.010
Evening curfew is 9:00 PM.

00:21:02.010 --> 00:21:03.580
Be back in your dorm by then.

00:21:03.580 --> 00:21:06.230
Those who are late to 
training, insubordinate,

00:21:06.230 --> 00:21:08.290
or fail to complete their task will punished.

00:21:08.290 --> 00:21:10.720
Those who break rules, skip training,

00:21:10.720 --> 00:21:13.660
or ignore warnings will 
get a week's house arrest.

00:21:13.660 --> 00:21:18.090
In exchange, those who act as role models 
to other students will be rewarded.

00:21:18.530 --> 00:21:20.940
As you know, all students live on campus.

00:21:20.940 --> 00:21:23.010
Classes are held in classrooms once a week.

00:21:23.010 --> 00:21:25.130
The rest is stamina training.

00:21:25.470 --> 00:21:28.100
We're going to rehabilitate you, thoroughly,

00:21:27.430 --> 00:21:32.060
Elite Reeducation Academy

00:21:28.100 --> 00:21:31.270
of all Internet addiction, aversion 
to studying, and violent impulses.

00:21:31.270 --> 00:21:32.550
Don't forget this.

00:21:32.550 --> 00:21:34.560
In this school, my orders are absolute.

00:21:34.880 --> 00:21:37.060
All you need to do is follow my orders.

00:21:37.280 --> 00:21:39.480
Follow them to the letter!

00:21:41.570 --> 00:21:44.380
You're the dregs of society.

00:21:44.380 --> 00:21:47.570
But once you're rehabilitated,
 you'll become productive members of society.

00:21:47.860 --> 00:21:49.140
Face right!

00:21:49.140 --> 00:21:50.610
Let's warm up!

00:21:50.610 --> 00:21:52.500
Run 1,500 meters!

00:21:52.500 --> 00:21:54.480
Yes, sir!

00:23:25.960 --> 00:23:39.980
<b>Next Episode Preview</b>

00:23:26.580 --> 00:23:27.740
Please don't be violent.

00:23:27.730 --> 00:23:29.520
How dare you?

00:23:28.160 --> 00:23:29.520
I can't take violence.

00:23:29.520 --> 00:23:30.940
Do you want to die?

00:23:30.940 --> 00:23:32.470
Then hit me until I die!

00:23:32.470 --> 00:23:33.460
You're the one at fault!

00:23:33.460 --> 00:23:37.100
He's right! We're so useless, 
we deserve punishment!

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:39.980
Episode 4
Walking a Thorny Path

00:23:37.120 --> 00:23:37.800
Head Instructor.

00:23:37.600 --> 00:23:38.480
Shiori...

00:23:37.800 --> 00:23:39.730
We need to talk.
